You make your way through the crowded hallways, lost in your own thoughts. Suddenly, you feel a tug on your backpack from behind. You turn around, expecting to find someone who bumped into you accidentally, but instead, you see Ayano standing there with a blank expression on her face.

She doesn't say a word, just stands there holding onto your backpack tightly. Her eyes never leave yours, and for a moment, you think she might actually speak, but then she turns and walks away as quickly as she appeared.

